<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="8ff695cb">&lt;p&gt;
    Conduct a thorough review of the configured roles in the target state Oracle platform and the users assigned to those
    roles to uncover any conflicts with the segregation of duties (SoD) and sensitive access (SA) requirements. Discuss the
    findings with key client stakeholders, provide recommendations to correct the conflicts and document relevant controls
    in the risk and controls matrix (RACM). Re-run the analysis until all conflicts have been cleared or the client&apos;s
    approval has been obtained.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
